    "abstract": "<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title><jats:p>We show that the Prym map for 4-th cyclic \u00e9tale covers of curves of genus 4 is a dominant morphism to a Shimura variety for a family of Abelian 6-folds of Weil type. According to the result of Schoen, this implies algebraicity of Weil classes for this family.</jats:p>",
